      Appendix Figure S 2.6.1: The landscape of spEMO. (a) The zero-shot embedding framework of spEMO. Here we introduce embeddings from PFMs and LLMs to help the analysis of spatial multi-omic datasets, by transferring the selected dataset from the expression space to the embedding space. (b) The renewed framework with an expert-model-involved setting of spEMO. By integrating the image representations and expression profiles to domain-expert methods, spEMO is capable of performing more downstream applications.
